# ─── Postgres ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local: Neon free tier (https://neon.tech) or a local Postgres.
# Production: Neon's POOLED connection string (URL ends in `-pooler`) is
# required for Vercel — serverless cold-starts will otherwise exhaust the
# Postgres connection pool. See docs/multi-repo-deploy.md.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/ledger_core?schema=public"

# ─── Auth stub secret ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HMAC secret for the dev-only auth cookie. Min 16 chars. Production MUST
# set this explicitly (the code throws if NODE_ENV=production and it's
# unset). Use the SAME value across all 5 repos so a user session is
# portable. v0.4 follow-up: replace this stub with Clerk or NextAuth.
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
# AUTH_STUB_SECRET=""

# ─── Internal HTTP boundary token ────────────────────────────────────────
# Gates POST /api/internal/journal-entries, /api/internal/fixed-asset,
# /api/internal/fixed-asset/record-depreciation. ALL companion repos
# (recon, revenue-rec, fa-amort) must set their LEDGER_CORE_INTERNAL_TOKEN
# to the SAME value. Unset = endpoints return 503 (fail closed).
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
# INTERNAL_API_TOKEN=""

# ─── Admin reset gate ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required to enable POST /api/admin/reset on the live demo so random
# visitors can't wipe it. Unset = 503. Optional; only set if you're
# running a public demo and want a "reset to seed" hook.
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
# ADMIN_TOKEN=""

# ─── Optional ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only used by companion repos. ledger-core has no AI calls at runtime.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""
